    {
      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-guts-2020-p4.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "We have \\(105^{3}-104^{3}=105^{2}+105 \\cdot 104+104^{2}\\). Thus\n\n\\[104 \\sqrt{3}<\\sqrt{105^{3}-104^{3}}<105 \\sqrt{3}\\]\n\nNow estimating gives the bounds \\(180<104 \\sqrt{3}\\) and \\(105 \\sqrt{3}<182\\). So the answer is 181 .",
